      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CALL-ZUW01SJA-001.
               CALL 'ZUW01SJA' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZUW01SJA FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
